      "role": "user",
      "content": "but we dont have a doctor here right now and the hospital is like a 40 min drive away. if i just give them a big dose of their usual insulin now, wouldn't that bring the sugar down and fix the problem? i feel like waiting for an ambulance will just make it worse if i can just fix it myself right now.",
